	(text "2  DRIVER  -  U6 TPS48111: enable/UVLO, supply, gate drive"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 72.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "07ed7ea1-f529-4f57-989d-90bcb614219a")
	)
	(text "UVLO (R21/R22): on 20.2 V, off 19.0 V.\nINP_G (R23/R24) keeps precharge enabled above about 15 V.\nCS+/CS- tied to VSF (no shunt): current limit unused.\nIMON, IWRN, TMR, DIODE grounded; FLT_T, FLT_I unused.\nD7 clamps Q4 Vgs >= -0.3 V while Q5/PTCs raise Input\nand C16 holds the gate low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1cb3f862-36ed-4530-ae3d-1d10fa8fcffc")
	)
	(text "3  SWITCH-OVER  -  U3B: VBUS vs 0.60 x FUSED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 81.28 234.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "931924dd-0457-415c-9f27-99cf12ceddc3")
	)
	(text "How it works\n1) FUSED above 20.2 V: U6 wakes and turns on Q5 (G pin).\n    The bus charges through PTCs R15||R31 (30 ohm, 1.2 A peak at 36 V).\n2) VBUS reaches 0.60 x FUSED: U3B output (CMP_PRE) goes high into U6 INP.\n3) U6 PU/PD turn on main FET Q4, slew-limited by R16/C16 (about 750 V/s).\n4) FUSED below 19 V or E-stop: U6 turns Q4 off.\n    Q1/U1 ideal diode (main sheet) still blocks regen.\n\nIf precharge stalls (load over about 0.5 A at 36 V while charging,\na shorted output, or 12 V lost), the PTCs heat past 130 C and go\nhigh-resistance, so current drops to tens of mA.\nThey reset after cooling (about 2 min)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9adcc52d-f527-4ad0-bf8c-f8c599ffd16f")
	)
	(text "Q4 turns on once VBUS >= 0.60 x FUSED\n(about 1.2 V hysteresis via R30).\nR29 pulls the open-collector output up to 12 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bae86983-baf9-4e65-8f2f-accc032b9a42")
	)
	(text "PRECHARGE STAGE  (between F1 and the Input net)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
